OL,3,ACalifornia sues OpenAI over Hugging
OL,4,AFace attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FCalifornia Attorney General Rob Bonta
OL,7,Fsued OpenAI on Monday, alleging the
OL,8,FChatGPT-maker misled and endangered the
OL,9,Fpublic by developing artificial
OL,10,Fintelligence (AI) models without proper
OL,11,Fsafeguards.
OL,13,FIn the lawsuit, Bonta cited the July
OL,14,F2026 attack on the AI platform Hugging
OL,15,FFace by experimental OpenAI agents
OL,16,Fwhich accessed the internet to breach
OL,17,Fthat company's internal systems.
OL,19,FBonta claimed OpenAI created a public
OL,20,Fnuisance and violated the state's
OL,21,Funfair competition laws.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
